<title>NETHERLANDS: Akzo Nobel buys Borden unit.</title>
<headline>Akzo Nobel buys Borden unit.</headline>
<dateline>ARNHEM, Netherlands 1996-11-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Chemical group Akzo Nobel NV said on Friday it had acquired the resin impregnated papers operation from U.S. chemicals and plastics group Borden.</p>
<p>The unit, which is based in South Carolina, has annual sales of about 25 million guilders ($14.7 million) and 35 employees. ($ = 1.696 Dutch Guilders)</p>
